# CR 702.37a, 702.37e, 118.3, 708.2 (a face-down creature has no subtypes). Raven Guild Initiate is cast face down for exactly
# {3} (Black Lotus's three mana, the pool empty right after): a nameless 2/2, which is not a Bird itself. "Morph-Return a Bird you
# control to its owner's hand": on turn 3 only Bot2's Aven Envoy is a Bird, so the turn-up is refused; once Bot1 has its own Aven
